{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57160","headline":"有沙门问大士那不出家答曰不敢住家不敢出家尔时又爲东乡侯率题二章略说理要云 · 傅翕","name":"有沙门问大士那不出家答曰不敢住家不敢出家尔时又爲东乡侯率题二章略说理要云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"脱中如不如，缚中莫如相。\n乃会三菩提，如如等无上。\n法相并无双，恒乖未曾各。\n沈浮随不随，摇漾泊无泊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"傅翕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}